    "detailed_description": "The game takes place in an abandoned mansion in the suburbs after an underground party. You wake up alone and lost, finding the place deserted and immersed in darkness. In your search through the somber chambers you perceive a sinister presence that haunts you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/cdd217b5f587cdf53fc1faed01dd94f1.poster.avif?t=1729784514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/cdd217b5f587cdf53fc1faed01dd94f1.webm?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/cdd217b5f587cdf53fc1faed01dd94f1.mp4?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Equipped with a lamp and a lighter to help you illuminate your path, you must scavenge for resources to unlock new areas before it is too late to escape the mansion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a3f473269b11b93b5e132b494b2d88f4.poster.avif?t=1729784514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a3f473269b11b93b5e132b494b2d88f4.webm?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a3f473269b11b93b5e132b494b2d88f4.mp4?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Intricate rooms are randomly generated ensuring a novel and tense experience on each playthrough.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a1f9324265d130465ae6d135adda49fb.poster.avif?t=1729784514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a1f9324265d130465ae6d135adda49fb.webm?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a1f9324265d130465ae6d135adda49fb.mp4?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "The game takes place in an abandoned mansion in the suburbs after an underground party. You wake up alone and lost, finding the place deserted and immersed in darkness. In your search through the somber chambers you perceive a sinister presence that haunts you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/cdd217b5f587cdf53fc1faed01dd94f1.poster.avif?t=1729784514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/cdd217b5f587cdf53fc1faed01dd94f1.webm?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/cdd217b5f587cdf53fc1faed01dd94f1.mp4?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Equipped with a lamp and a lighter to help you illuminate your path, you must scavenge for resources to unlock new areas before it is too late to escape the mansion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a3f473269b11b93b5e132b494b2d88f4.poster.avif?t=1729784514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a3f473269b11b93b5e132b494b2d88f4.webm?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a3f473269b11b93b5e132b494b2d88f4.mp4?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Intricate rooms are randomly generated ensuring a novel and tense experience on each playthrough.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a1f9324265d130465ae6d135adda49fb.poster.avif?t=1729784514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a1f9324265d130465ae6d135adda49fb.webm?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981840/extras/a1f9324265d130465ae6d135adda49fb.mp4?t=1729784514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Find your way out of an abandoned mansion, avoiding an evil entity set on hunting you as you escape through pitch black rooms. Scavenge for resources to keep the dark at bay and solve puzzles to move forward. Escaping Darkness is an escape room-based survival horror game designed for VR.",
